Description: Calculator search plugin for DDE Grand Search
 A DDE Grand Search plugin that provides real-time mathematical
 expression evaluation in the global search bar. Users can type
 expressions like "1+2*3", "sin(0.5)", or "(3+4)^2" and get instant
 results. Clicking a result copies the value to the clipboard.
 .
 Features include:
  * Real-time expression parsing powered by ExprTk
  * Support for arithmetic, trigonometry, and common math functions
  * Click-to-copy result to system clipboard
  * Auto-mode integration with dde-grand-search-daemon
